{"unit_id":"Ghoscro__dsh-ace#feature-composer-ghost","repo":"Ghoscro/dsh-ace","commit":"f3c27f1971dcb00afadc000025669eee8c9a76be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH ACE 的功能「输入框幽灵补全」：用户输入时可请求简短补全文字，并在光标处预览；按 Tab 接受，继续输入会丢弃补全。页面还提供流式和本地快速补全入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:625-626","client.js:935-956","index.js:2668-2750"]}
